<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="_8hBUlFJWdTPHK48v0Rs">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1380" dy="993" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\n  \&quot;theme\&quot;: \&quot;base\&quot;,\n  \&quot;themeVariables\&quot;: {\n    \&quot;background\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;primaryBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;lineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;secondaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;tertiaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorBkg\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorBorder\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;actorLineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;signalColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;signalTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelBoxBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelBoxBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;labelTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;loopTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;noteTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;,\n    \&quot;activationBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;,\n    \&quot;activationBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;\n  }\n}}%%\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    title UC5 — HR Confirms Daily Route Allocation\n\n    actor HR\n    participant Page as DailyAllocationPage\n    participant Controller as DailyAllocationController\n    participant UseCase as DailyAllocationUseCase\n    participant Repository as RouteRepository\n    participant DB as Supabase\n\n    HR-&gt;&gt;Page: Open daily-allocation confirmation page\n    activate Page\n\n    Page-&gt;&gt;Controller: getDailyAllocation()\n    activate Controller\n\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;UseCase: getDailyAllocation()\n    activate UseCase\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;DB: Read database server time\n    activate DB\n    Note over UseCase,DB: Convert the server time to&lt;br/&gt;the Bangkok business date\n    DB--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Current business date\n    deactivate DB\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;Repository: listByDate(date)\n    activate Repository\n\n    Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query today&#39;s routes&lt;br/&gt;ordered by departure time\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Route rows\n    deactivate DB\n\n    alt No routes exist for today\n        Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Empty Route[]\n\n    else Routes exist\n        par Load route stops\n            Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query route_stops and stops&lt;br/&gt;ordered by stop_order\n            DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Ordered route stops\n        and Load assigned buses\n            Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query bus_assignments and buses\n            DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Assigned buses\n        end\n\n        Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Assemble routes with their&lt;br/&gt;stops, buses and finalized status\n        Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Route[]\n    end\n\n    deactivate Repository\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;UseCase: Sort routes by departure time,&lt;br/&gt;then by number of stops\n    UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: Daily allocation\n    deactivate UseCase\n\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Controller: Format date and route view models\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Page: DailyAllocationView\n    deactivate Controller\n\n    alt No routes exist\n        Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display “ยังไม่มีเส้นทางของวันนี้”\n\n    else All routes are already finalized\n        Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display route summaries and&lt;br/&gt;confirmation-completed message\n\n    else Unfinalized routes exist\n        Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display route summaries and&lt;br/&gt;daily-allocation confirmation button\n    end\n\n    deactivate Page\n\n    opt Unfinalized routes exist\n        HR-&gt;&gt;Page: Click “ยืนยันการเลือกเส้นทางการเดินรถ”\n        activate Page\n\n        Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Disable button and display&lt;br/&gt;“กำลังแจ้งเตือน...”\n\n        Page-&gt;&gt;Controller: confirmDailyAllocation()\n        activate Controller\n\n        Controller-&gt;&gt;UseCase: confirmDailyAllocation()\n        activate UseCase\n\n        UseCase-&gt;&gt;Repository: finalizeDaily()\n        activate Repository\n\n        Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Read database server time\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Current Bangkok business date\n        deactivate DB\n\n        Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query today&#39;s routes\n        activate DB\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Route rows\n        deactivate DB\n\n        alt Today&#39;s route list is not empty\n            par Load route stops\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query route_stops and stops\n                DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Route stops\n            and Load assigned buses\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query bus_assignments and buses\n                DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Bus assignments\n            end\n\n            Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Assemble route entities\n        end\n\n        Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Keep routes where finalized is false\n\n        alt No unfinalized routes remain\n            Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Empty notification result\n\n        else Unfinalized routes exist\n            Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Collect distinct bus IDs&lt;br/&gt;from unfinalized routes\n\n            opt Assigned buses exist\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query dirver_assignments&lt;br/&gt;for today&#39;s assigned buses\n                activate DB\n                Note over Repository,DB: Find drivers who confirmed a bus&lt;br/&gt;used by an unfinalized route\n                DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Driver user IDs\n                deactivate DB\n\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Deduplicate driver IDs\n            end\n\n            loop For each unfinalized route\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Collect the route&#39;s stop IDs\n\n                opt Route contains stops\n                    Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Query bookings by date,&lt;br/&gt;departure time and stop IDs\n                    activate DB\n                    Note over Repository,DB: Find employees whose bookings&lt;br/&gt;belong to this route\n                    DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Employee user IDs\n                    deactivate DB\n\n                    Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Deduplicate employee IDs\n                end\n            end\n\n            Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Create driver-message records\n            Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Create employee-message records\n\n            alt No notification recipients exist\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;Repository: Skip message insertion\n\n            else Notification recipients exist\n                Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Insert driver and employee&lt;br/&gt;messages in one batch\n                activate DB\n\n                alt Message insertion fails\n                    DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Database error\n                    deactivate DB\n                    Note over Repository,DB: Routes remain unfinalized\n                    Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Propagate error\n                    UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: Confirmation failed\n                    Controller--&gt;&gt;Page: Return failure\n                    Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display confirmation failure\n\n                else Messages are saved\n                    DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Insert succeeded\n                    deactivate DB\n\n                    Repository-&gt;&gt;DB: Update unfinalized routes&lt;br/&gt;SET finalized = true\n                    activate DB\n\n                    alt Route update fails\n                        DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Database error\n                        deactivate DB\n                        Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Propagate error\n                        UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: Confirmation failed\n                        Controller--&gt;&gt;Page: Return failure\n                        Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display confirmation failure\n\n                    else Routes are finalized\n                        DB--&gt;&gt;Repository: Update succeeded\n                        deactivate DB\n\n                        Repository--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Driver and employee&lt;br/&gt;notification totals\n                    end\n                end\n            end\n        end\n\n        deactivate Repository\n\n        UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: DailyNotificationResult\n        deactivate UseCase\n\n        Controller-&gt;&gt;Controller: Revalidate route, confirmation&lt;br/&gt;and notification pages\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Page: Return confirmation success\n        deactivate Controller\n\n        Page-&gt;&gt;Page: Keep confirmation button disabled\n        Page--&gt;&gt;HR: Display confirmation message&lt;br/&gt;with notification totals\n\n        deactivate Page\n    end\n\n    Note over Repository,DB: All “today” values come from the&lt;br/&gt;Supabase server clock, not the Node clock&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="qXoLK3iACDr2OCKkccRt-714">
